<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Privacy Policy — ResellingShoes.com</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://resellingshoes.com/privacy">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon-16x16.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="192x192" href="/android-chrome-192x192.png">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;0,9..40,700;0,9..40,800;1,9..40,400&family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --ink: #1A1A1A; --ink-2: #3A3630; --ink-3: #6b6b6b; --ink-4: #A39D97;
      --cream: #faf8f5; --cream-dark: #f0ece4; --border: #e5e0d8;
      --walnut: #C4943A; --green: #2F8B5C; --green-hover: #267049;
      --serif: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
      --sans: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    }
    body { font-family: var(--sans); background: var(--cream); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.7; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
    a { color: var(--green); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    nav {
      background: rgba(250,248,245,0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0 24px; height: 64px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
    }
    .nav-logo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 18px; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-logo span { color: var(--green); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 28px; align-items: center; }
    .nav-links a { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink-3); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-cta { background: var(--green); color: #fff !important; padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700 !important; }
    .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--green-hover) !important; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .nav-links a:not(.nav-cta) { display: none; } }

    .page-wrap { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 24px 96px; }

    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--walnut); margin-bottom: 12px; display: block;
    }
    h1 {
      font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
      line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--ink);
    }
    .last-updated { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-4); margin-bottom: 40px; }

    .prose h2 {
      font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--ink);
      margin-top: 36px; margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .prose p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: 14px; line-height: 1.8; }
    .prose ul { margin: 12px 0 14px 20px; }
    .prose ul li { font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: 6px; line-height: 1.7; }

    .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin: 40px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <a href="/" class="nav-logo">Reselling<span>Shoes</span>.com</a>
  <div class="nav-links">
    <a href="/learn">Learn</a>
    <a href="/the-everyday-shoe-flip">The Playbook</a>
    <a href="/1000-shoe-reselling-method" class="nav-cta">Free Guide</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="page-wrap">
  <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="last-updated">Last updated: July 2026</div>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>ResellingShoes.com is a personal site operated by Timothy Hales. This policy explains what information is collected when you visit this site and how it is used.</p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect information in two ways:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Information you provide</strong> — If you enter your email address to receive the free guide or newsletter, that email is collected and stored by Kit (formerly ConvertKit). We do not store it ourselves.</li>
      <li><strong>Information collected automatically</strong> — When you visit this site, basic analytics data (pages viewed, referral source, general location) is collected via Google Analytics. This data is aggregated and anonymized.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>Email addresses are used only to send the content you requested (the free PDF guide) and occasional emails about reselling tips, new articles, or product updates. You can unsubscribe at any time using the link at the bottom of any email.</p>
    <p>Analytics data is used to understand which content is most useful and how the site is being found. It is never sold or shared with third parties for advertising purposes.</p>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>This site uses the following third-party services, each with their own privacy policies:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Kit (ConvertKit)</strong> — email list management and delivery. <a href="https://convertkit.com/privacy" target="_blank">Kit Privacy Policy</a></li>
      <li><strong>Gumroad</strong> — payment processing for digital products (The Everyday Shoe Flip). <a href="https://gumroad.com/privacy" target="_blank">Gumroad Privacy Policy</a></li>
      <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — website analytics. <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy</a></li>
      <li><strong>Vercel</strong> — website hosting. <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank">Vercel Privacy Policy</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>Google Analytics uses cookies to track visits. Kit may set cookies related to form interactions. No other cookies are used. You can disable cookies in your browser settings at any time.</p>

    <h2>Your Choices</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To unsubscribe from emails, click the unsubscribe link in any email.</li>
      <li>To opt out of Google Analytics tracking, use the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</li>
      <li>To request deletion of your data, contact us directly.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:timothyehales@gmail.com">timothyehales@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="footer-root"></div>
<script is:inline src="/js/footer.js"></script>

</body>
</html>
